ion, archive, or expiration policies that are applied to its contents. Organizations can facilitate policy enforcement by providing such folders for users to classify email messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="381857">Managed E-mail Folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918526">Faili ya Barua pepe Iliyodhibitiwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11985_115735_1399186"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database query and programming language widely used for accessing, querying, updating, and managing data in relational database systems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115735">SQL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1399186">SQL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11985_115735_533711"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database query and programming language widely used for accessing, querying, updating, and managing data in relational database systems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115735">SQL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="533711">Lugha Ulizo Unde