lows users to create professional looking information graphics quickly and easily.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="545625">SmartArt graphics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918542">SmartArt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12141_56316_1918296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Two arrows in shape of a cross, with two heads each pointing in opposite directions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="56316">four-headed arrow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918296">mshale uliyo na vichwa vinne</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12144_237193_1447898"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To place a file or project back in a source repository. This releases the lock for editing and enables other users to view the updated file or check out the file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237193">check in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1447898">pakia kwa matumizi ya wengine</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNo