 of words or other text used to gain access to a network, program, or data. A passphrase is generally longer for added security.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486351">pass phrase</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1397147">fungu nywila</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13076_269325_1397147"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sequence of words or other text used to gain access to a network, program, or data. A passphrase is generally longer for added security.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="269325">passphrase</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1397147">fungu nywila</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13078_397139_1952732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A folder that exists by default in all users’ mailboxes. The Inbox, Outbox, Sent Items, Deleted Items, Calendar, and Contacts folders are default folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397139">default folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1952732">folda msingi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, T