t (IDE) that provides logical code elements that the user can select from a drop-down menu while coding.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="583814">IntelliSense</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576184">IntelliSense</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16438_584264_1918553"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares values across categories. The categories are organized horizontally, and values vertically, to emphasize variation over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584264">clustered column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918553">chati safuwima ya kishada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16439_584277_1918554"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares the percentage that each value contributes to a total across categories.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584277">100% stacked column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918554">100% ya Safuwima mpororo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16440_584278_1918555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares data points along two axes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584278">3-D column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918555">Chati safuwima P-3</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16441_584279_1918556"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variation on a column chart that uses cylinder shapes instead of rectangular columns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584279">cylinder chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918556">chati ya silinda</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16442_584280_1918557"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variation on a column chart that uses cone shapes instead of rectangular columns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584280">cone chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Sing