ocations. The locations might be on your computer, an external hard drive, removable media, or someone else’s computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1047661">Windows library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1389239">maktaba</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20723_746479_1389239"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of items, such as files and folders, assembled from various locations. The locations might be on your computer, an external hard drive, removable media, or someone else’s computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746479">library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1389239">maktaba</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20724_746483_1389328"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To mark an item so that it always appears in a specific place in the UI or in a list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746483">pin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1389328">bana</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"