r server farm, or another search engine that is compliant with the OpenSearch protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636440">result source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918943">nyenzo ya matokeo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29149_1506722_2311271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for items that are deleted. Items in this container are visible to users with the appropriate permissions and to site collection administrators.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506722">first-stage Recycle Bin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2311271">Kijalala cha awamu ya kwanza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29193_1644672_1918983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that renders named objects or named items in a workbook, such as tables, charts, slicers or a named range of cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644672">named item view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918983">muonekano wa kipengee tajwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">K