edding (OLE) to create and add objects to a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508813">DecoType Naskh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918843">DecoType Naskh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29466_1508814_1918844"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Ruq'ah script that enriches the display of Arabic text. This script uses object linking and embedding (OLE) to create and add objects to a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508814">DecoType Ruq'ah</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918844">DecoType Ruq'ah</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29473_1508823_1918845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An administrative tool that examines a computer, server farm, or server cluster and provides statistics that indicate the degree to which the configuration meets expected demands.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508823">health analyzer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1918845">kichanganuzi cha afya</term><termNote type="geogra