e name of a product in the store that appears to customers. To the end user, this is the name of the product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608235">app name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1642178">jina la programu-tumizi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31660_1608236_2243065"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains the app manifest, executable files, text and image resource files, and other files that make up the app for a single platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608236">app package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2243065">kifurushi cha programu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31663_1608239_1642187"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Collected data about an app, such as analytics of download, usage, in-application transaction, customer ratings provided by the Windows Store developer portal. This type of information helps developers clearly understand how their applications are doing in the Windows market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608239">App Summary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1642187">muhtasari wa programu-tumizi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31664_1608240_1642190"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Store service that enables end users to update apps one at a time or all at the same time for all apps purchased through the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608240">App Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1642190">Kisasisho cha Programu tumizi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31668_1611161_1780046"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The stage of an app in the certification process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1611161">certification status</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1780046">hali ya uhakikisho</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31670_1612553_1642856"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A link that takes you to a precise loca