 mode in the Windows Maps app that provides turn-by-turn directions with both audio and visual guidance that changes as the user travels along the route to their destination.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065228">voice navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2460841">uabiri unaoongozwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35713_2459049_2119130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature or mode in the Windows Maps app that provides turn-by-turn directions with both audio and visual guidance that changes as the user travels along the route to their destination.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2459049">guided navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2119130">uabiri wa sauti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35713_2459049_2460841"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature or mode in the Windows Maps app that provides turn-by-turn directions with both audio and visual guidance that changes as the user travels along the route to their destination.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2459049">guided navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular<