oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37587_2144639_2218779"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The full-screen view of Start that includes the list of items, such as apps, websites, and other info that a person can specify and customize. It is what is displayed when the Start button is used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144639">Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2218779">Skrini ya kuanza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37588_2144650_2218778"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The resizable view of Start. It can be resized to show the list of items, such as apps, websites, and other info that a person can specify and customize.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144650">Start menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2218778">Menyu ya kuanza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37588_2144652_2218778"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The resizable view of Start. It can be resized to show the list of items, such as apps, website