 Toolbox that allows users to choose a personal set of pens and highlighters for inking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569053">Ink Toolbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576728">Kisandukuzana  cha Wino</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45578_2569566_2574200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of games that are optimized for Xbox One X console.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569566">Xbox One X Enhanced</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574200">Xbox One X Iliyoboreshwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45579_2569567_2581562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The premium 4K gaming and entertainment console from Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569567">Xbox One X</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2581562">Xbox One X</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45581_2569585_2576193"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft To-Do feature that enables a user to share a list with other users. All users will be able to add and complete to-dos in a shared list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569585">Sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576193">Kushiriki</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45582_2569597_2576194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft To-Do feature that enables a user to break down a to-do into smaller components of work or effort.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569597">Steps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576194">Hatua</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45583_2569598_2572249"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The binding process where authentication is one-directional.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569598">1-way binding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig