 same column or row as the active cell.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618265">End mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621174">Modi ya mwisho</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4652_236971_1399253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software that was installed on the system without user's consent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236971">unwanted software</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1399253">programu zisizohitajika</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46533_2619438_2621126"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Windows Defender Security Center that helps protect devices running Windows 10 by checking web content that Microsoft Store apps use.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619438">App protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621126">Ulinzi wa programu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46534_2619566_2621127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Windows Defender Security Center that helps protect devices running Windows 10 from malicious websites and downloads.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619566">Web protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621127">Ulinzi wa wavuti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46539_2619581_2621114"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that lets users choose which buttons perform which actions on Xbox Wireless Controllers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619581">Xbox Accessories</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621114">Vikorokoro vya Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619582_2621095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619582">Xbox Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</te