section of the Productivity Score in M365 admin center, which provides data, insights and recommendations related to optimization of devices, software, and other technology in your organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2831275">Technology experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822526">uzoefu wa teknolojia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49858_2831275_2835180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in M365 admin center, which provides data, insights and recommendations related to optimization of devices, software, and other technology in your organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2831275">Technology experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835180">Uzoefu wa teknolojia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49859_2819431_2822503"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">MMD device profile that provides local administrator privileges for users who need more control of their issued devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819431">Privileged access device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822503">Wasifu wa kifaa cha ufikiaji wa upendeleo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4986_37166_1779131"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device capable of processing information, storing data, and producing a desired result based on instructions provided.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37166">computer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1779131">kompyuta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49860_2819434_2822500"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The MMD device profile that offers the greatest power to the local user (ability to install apps, etc.). Intended for use typically by developers, field engineers, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819434">Power user device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822500">wasifu wa kifaa cha mtumiaji aliyepewa mamlaka makuu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49861_2819436_2822519"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The MMD device profile that is more &amp;quot;locked down&amp;quot; to preserve the security of sensitive data. Intended for handling sensitive data such as medical records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819436">Sensitive data device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822519">Wasifu wa kifaa cha data nyeti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49862_2819437_2822522"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The MMD device profile that has the most balance of user privileges and data security--expected to be the most common profile and used by typical information workers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819437">Standard device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822522">Wasifu wa kifaa wastani</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49864_2819441_2822493"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of the proposed MMD device profiles. This would support a single app without requiring a user sign in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819441">Kiosk device profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822493">Wasifu wa kifaa cha kioski</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49865_2819443_2822487"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in Microsoft 365, which includes insights and recommendations about usage of Microsoft 365 products that are related to employee productivity, engagement, wellbeing, and related concepts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819443">employee experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822487">uzoefu wa mwajiriwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49865_2819443_2835179"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in Microsoft 365, which includes insights and recommendations about usage of Microsoft 365 products that are related to employee productivity, engagement, wellbeing, and related concepts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819443">employee experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835179">Uzoefu wa mwajiriwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49865_2831277_2822487"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in Microsoft 365, which includes insights and recommendations about usage of Microsoft 365 products that are related to employee productivity, engagement, wellbeing, and related concepts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2831277">Employee experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822487">uzoefu wa mwajiriwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49865_2831277_2835179"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in Microsoft 365, which includes insights and recommendations about usage of Microsoft 365 products that are related to employee productivity, engagement, wellbeing, and related concepts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2831277">Employee experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835179">Uzoefu wa mwajiriwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49866_2819444_2822516"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of Microsoft-recommended configuration settings along with an explanation of their security impact. These settings are based on feedback from Microsoft security engineering teams, product groups, partners, and customers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819444">security baseline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822516">mstari msingi wa usalama</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49867_2819445_2822525"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A value that the customer defines, which represents a goal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819445">target</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822525">lengwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49868_2819447_2822474"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft 365 scores, a recommendation based on data from your organization, which, if completed, results directly or indirectly in points earned to improve your score. This can be a direct action like changing a setting, or an indirect action like providing training to users that encourages them to use a feature more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819447">action</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822474">kitendo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49868_2819447_2822492"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft 365 scores, a recommendation based on data from your organization, which, if completed, results directly or indirectly in points earned to improve your score. This can be a direct action like changing a setting, or an indirect action like providing training to users that encourages them to use a feature more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819447">action</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822492">kitendo cha uboreshaji</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49868_2819447_2822504"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft 365 scores, a recommendation based on data from your organization, which, if completed, results directly or indirectly in points earned to improve your score. This can be a direct action like changing a setting, or an indirect action like providing training to users that encourages them to use a feature more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819447">action</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><l