 security (IPSec) as a virtual private network (VPN) technology to provide remote access or router-to-router VPN connections. L2TP is described in RFC 2661.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318115">L2TP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1397055">Itifaki Futikizi ya Tabaka ya Pili</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5162_25316_533092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that provides goods and/or services to others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25316">business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="533092">biashara</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5172_20576_533062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The speed at which a modem transmits data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20576">baud</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="533062">baudi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></n