istance to water, fading and smudging, thus producing photographic prints with uniform gloss coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307399">gloss optimizer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="534536">kifaniboresho cha mng'ao</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7263_121042_2096425"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symbolic value used instead of a real value which in this case is text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="121042">text placeholder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2096425">kishikilia nafasi cha matini</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="727_126759_2762909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user account name (sometimes referred to as the user logon name) and a domain name identifying the domain in which the user account is located and which is the standard usage for logging on to a Windows domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="126759">user principal name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762909">jina msingi la mtumiaji</term><termNote type="geographi