e="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8218_231957_1165631"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PivotTable report that supplies the source data to the PivotChart report. It is created automatically when you create a new PivotChart report. When you change the layout of either report, the other also changes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231957">associated PivotTable report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1165631">Ripoti Jedwali Chegemo husiani</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="823_144037_533912"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of buttons representing hyperlinks to pages both within a Web site and to external sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144037">link bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sw"><ntig><termGrp><term id="533912">upau unganishi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KEN, TZA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="824_129372_1399265"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of or pertaining to a device or service that appears to the user as something it actually is not or that does no